WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.135
-As summer winds down --
sorry, what are these...

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:05.004
empty Heineken cans
doing on my desk?

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.205
-Sorry. [Laughs]

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:07.840
I had an end-of-summer
desk party last night.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:08.908
-Oh, hey, Ally.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.142
What's a desk party?

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.077
-What do you think?

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.544
It's a party on your desk.

00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:14.814
-Yeah, exactly -- my desk,
which you didn't clean up.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.882
-I'm here to clean them up
and recycle them right now.

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:18.151
-I can't believe
you had a desk party,

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.418
which is totally not a thing,
by the way,

00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:21.253
on my desk,
and didn't invite me.

00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:22.789
-The desk isn't that big, Seth.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.324
I had to make major cuts
to the guest list.

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.358
-How many people
could have possibly

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.692
come to this desk party?

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:27.994
-[ Coughs ]
Everyone on the crew.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.295
-Everyone in the crew
but not me?

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.898
-Relax. We just had
Heineken 0.0s. No alcohol.

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:34.233
Here, to make amends,
I got you a regular lager.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.502
-Hmm, well. Thank you.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:41.140
Now, that's some good
desk party Heineken.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:42.509
[ Clattering ]

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.879
I think you accidentally just
threw my jokes away.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.212
-Oh, they weren't that good.

00:00:47.212 --> 00:00:49.548
I wrote them last night
during the desk afterparty.

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:50.884
-How many desk parties
were there?

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.318
-Seth, I'm gonna level with you.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.620
There's no such thing
as a desk party.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.154
It's just called working.
-Right, I knew that.

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.322 line:0%
Now get out of here
so I can work.

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:02.395 line:0%
Now that is some good
solo desk party.

